<title>SHARJAH: CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND 192 ALL OUT V PAKISTAN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND 192 ALL OUT V PAKISTAN.</headline>
<dateline>SHARJAH, United Arab Emirates 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand were all out for 192 in their 50 overs in the last league match of the Singer Champions' Trophy tournament against Pakistan on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
